Dialogue: 1,0:23:37.98,0:23:39.98,標題,,0,0,0,,{\fsp15\an1\fscx160\fscy160\pos(401.6,931.2)}没经验{\\fscx140\fscy140}的{\bord7\3c&HECA000&\fscx160\fscy160}我{\fscx140\fscy140\bord3\3c&H000000&}和\N\N\N\N{\fscx160\fscy160}有经验{\\fscx140\fscy140}的{\bord7\fscx160\fscy160\3c&H0282F2&}你\N\N\N\N{\fscx160\fscy160\3c&H8B00F7&}初次约会{\fscx140\fscy140\bord3\3c&H000000&}的{\fscx160\fscy160}故事
